      <h1 data-dc-tpl="633" style="color: rgb(246, 239, 228); font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.8vw, 5rem); line-height: 0.94; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 14px 0px 0px; max-width: 18ch; text-transform: uppercase; text-wrap: balance;">The Margaritas People <span data-dc-tpl="634" style="color: rgb(56, 176, 73);">Text Their Friends About</span></h1>
